Package: trialfeasibility
Title: Clinical Trial Feasibility Explorer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Karthik", "Sengupta", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R Shiny dashboard over ClinicalTrials.gov data for the questions a
    feasibility team asks when designing a study: enrollment, site counts, duration,
    and how often and why trials stop early, by phase and therapeutic area. This file
    declares dependencies for CI and deployment; the project is not an R package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    bslib,
    DBI,
    DT,
    ggiraph,
    ggplot2,
    htmltools,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    openssl,
    RSQLite,
    scales,
    shiny
Suggests:
    rsconnect,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
